# Desktop launcher pair, generated per-machine by dev\tools\make-launcher.ps1 and never committed:
# the root .lnk bakes in this machine's absolute paths; app.ico is a packaging derivative.
# Anchored to the repo root so a nested, deliberately-tracked .lnk is unaffected.
/*.lnk
/app.ico
